# #! @Description
# #! Takes a list of bins with ids of groups of size <A>order</A> and splits
# #! them via the outcome of <A>test</A> implemented in `TestOnGroup`.
# #! @BeginExampleSession
# #! gap> SplitBinsViaTest([[1..10]], 512, "MaxSubId");
# #! [ [ 1 ], [ 2 ], [ 3, 8 ], [ 4 ], [ 5 ], [ 6, 7 ], [ 9 ], [ 10 ] ]
